# AtropOS uses plasma6-login-manager. systemd keeps the first match.
# This file is read before the display-manager slot (85) and before
# 87-default-MicroOS.preset. 95-default-SUSE.preset enables
# display-manager-legacy.service, which is the Kalpa TTY boot.
# A preset cannot retarget an existing display-manager.service symlink.
# patterns-atropos %post still force-enables plasmalogin.service.
disable display-manager-legacy.service
disable sddm.service
enable plasmalogin.service
